ivery owner must run scripts/reporter-ready.ts gsp-80r2c --vouch and verify its recei… |\n\n<details>\n<summary>Evidence: Live mail handoff receipts</summary>\n\n```text\n{\n  \"product\": \"real Next.js Pipe dev server\",\n  \"isolation\": \"new local Postgres cluster; real migrations and auth admission; synthetic CRM/mail data; Chromium profile and registered local mail capture handler\",\n  \"receipts\": [\n    {\n      \"scenario\": \"deal-contact-handoff\",\n      \"deal\": 10000097,\n      \"title\": \"Caterpillar VR\",\n      \"place\": \"primary\",\n      \"input\": \"click\",\n      \"href\": \"mailto:ava+qa@example.test?subject=Caterpillar%20VR\",\n      \"composer\": {\n        \"to\": \"ava+qa@example.test\",\n        \"subject\": \"Caterpillar VR\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"keys\": [\n          \"subject\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scenario\": \"deal-contact-handoff\",\n      \"deal\": 10000097,\n      \"title\": \"Caterpillar VR\",\n      \"place\": \"list-ava\",\n      \"input\": \"Tab then Enter\",\n      \"href\": \"mailto:ava+qa@example.test?subject=Caterpillar%20VR\",\n      \"composer\": {\n        \"to\": \"ava+qa@example.test\",\n        \"subject\": \"Caterpillar VR\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"keys\": [\n          \"subject\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scenario\": \"deal-contact-handoff\",\n      \"deal\": 10000097,\n      \"title\": \"Caterpillar VR\",\n      \"place\": \"list-ben\",\n      \"input\": \"Tab then Enter\",\n      \"href\": \"mailto:ben@example.test?subject=Caterpillar%20VR\",\n      \"composer\": {\n        \"to\": \"ben@example.test\",\n        \"subject\": \"Caterpillar VR\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"keys\": [\n          \"subject\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scenario\": \"deal-contact-handoff\",\n      \"deal\": 10000098,\n      \"title\": \"Acme & Café #1? + 100% / \\\"東京\\\"\",\n      \"place\": \"primary\",\n      \"input\": \"click\",\n 